# Money Manager

Personal finance cockpit (Flutter, local-first SQLite).

## Stack

- Flutter + Drift + Riverpod + **Forui** (`forui`) UI
- `vi` / `en` via ARB (`lib/l10n/`) + `FLocalizations` delegates
- Money as integer minor units (`lib/core/money/`); registry in `currencies.dart`
- Append-only ledger events (`lib/data/ledger/`) — never UPDATE/DELETE ledger rows for corrections; use correction/reversal events

## Commands

```bash
flutter pub get
flutter gen-l10n
dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs
flutter analyze
flutter test
flutter run
```

## Layout

- `lib/core/` — money, FX
- `lib/data/database/` — Drift schema + generated `*.g.dart`
- `lib/data/ledger/` — `LedgerWriter` (append + clientRequestId dedupe)
- `lib/data/providers/` — Riverpod database providers
- `lib/domain/` — enums (e.g. `LedgerEventType`)
- `lib/features/` — UI by feature (home, capture, insights, settings, shell)

